### 🎯 Conclusion

Overall, this project helped me understand how to create a complete website using **React.js, JSX, JavaScript, CSS, reusable components, images and external icons**.

I focused on keeping the design close to the provided UI and maintaining a proper component-based structure.

This project also helped me understand how a larger webpage can be divided into smaller reusable components instead of keeping everything inside a single file.

